      "content": "Wait, so you're saying the \"stronger\" position is definitely on the side of the presidency? \n\nI thought the whole point of the constitutional debate was the tension between those two roles. If you're saying it's \"essential\" to limit Congress to prevent them from being \"overly aggressive,\" aren't you basically arguing that the executive branch should have a blank check to hide stuff from the people's representatives? That seems like a pretty massive tilt toward one side of the argument.",
